      "uncertainty": "High. Previous attempts to parallelize intra-row reduction either caused correctness bugs (memory safety) or yielded no measurable speedup when fixed. The current kernel is correct but does not measurably outperform the incumbent due to limited problem size and/or insufficiently aggressive parallel decomposition."
